All 10 samples map to 10 distinct class IDs, exactly matching the adapter's 20-language label set (fr, es, de, it, pt, ru, ja, zh, ar, en) with ≥93.6% confidence each.

**Robustness checks**:
- Both saved directories reload cleanly with `from_pretrained`, `num_labels=20`, head `[20, 768]`
- Added `num_labels` explicitly to both `config.json` files so older/newer Transformers versions always build the 20-class head
- Included `sentencepiece.bpe.model` + `special_tokens_map.json` so both fast and slow tokenizers work
- Re-ran inference on the saved merged model and confirmed results reproduce exactly

Artifacts: `/app/model_cache/xlm-roberta-base` (~1.1 GB, configured base), `/app/merged_model` (~1.1 GB, merged), `/app/adapter_cache`, `/app/detection_results.json`.
